, love, hate, enjoy, o verbo seguinte fica na forma -ing: I love swimming.","Para negar, use don't/doesn't like + -ing: She doesn't like running.","Para perguntas: Do/Does + subject + like/love/hate + -ing + ...?"],"table":{"headers":["Verbo","Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Love","love + verb-ing","I love painting."],["Like","like + verb-ing","She likes dancing."],["Hate","hate + verb-ing","He hates cleaning."],["Enjoy","enjoy + verb-ing","We enjoy hiking."],["Negativo","don't/doesn't + like + verb-ing","They don't like cooking."]]}},"quiz":[{"q":"I love ___ books. (read)","a":"reading","opts":["read","reads","reading","to reading"]},{"q":"She hates ___ the dishes. (wash)","a":"washing","opts":["wash","washes","washing","to wash"]},{"q":"Do you enjoy ___? (cook)","a":"cooking","opts":["cook","cooks","cooking","to cooking"]},{"q":"He doesn't like ___ early. (wake up)","a":"waking up","opts":["wake up","waking up","wakes up","to wake up"]},{"q":"We love ___ in the mountains. (hike)","a":"hiking","opts":["hike","hikes","hiking","to hiking"]}],"speak":["I love reading books.","She likes painting.","He hates cleaning.","Do you enjoy cooking?","We love hiking together."],"lang":"en"}